  "reading": "The missing rank-8 bridge is not the naive A2-triplet collapse of the full 78-triplet packet. It appears when the adjacent E6 sector is first summed over its local triplets and then contrasted along the ternary point order on each of the four W33 lines through the anchor point. Four lines times two independent point contrasts gives eight vectors. In the golden 24D eigenspace those vectors have exact clean Gram spectra {3/2,9/2} for the through+away quotient and {3/10,9/10} for the complementary quotient.",
